{
  "schema": "ss-k3-char5-d0-d2-high-rank-no-go-v1",
  "claim": "Every nontrivial subgroup-fixed slice of hyperbolic dimension >9 inside the three published period-preserving groups Aut_X(D0), Aut_X(D1), Aut_X(D2) is one of seven H13 involution casts, and every cast fails the exact Coxeter-angle gate.",
  "scope_warning": "This is not a theorem about the full lattice stabilizers Aut(D_i), nor about every induced chamber of the surface. The source lists Aut_X(D_i)=Aut(D_i) intersect G_X; it does not publish Aut(D_i). It also reports many further chamber classes without complete wall/stabilizer matrices.",
